      "title": "Artworks stolen from Renoir Museum on French Riviera in latest heist",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/08/artworks-stolen-france-renoir-museum-french-riviera-art-heist",
      "description": "<p>Thieves took four artworks but it is thought they dropped two in museum garden as they fled</p><p>Two thieves have broken into a museum dedicated to the French impressionist painter Pierre-Auguste Renoir in southern France, stealing four artworks but leaving two behind as they fled.</p><p>“This morning, two individuals broke into the Renoir Museum and stole four works of art,” said Bryan Masson, the mayor of Cagnes-sur-Mer.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/08/artworks-stolen-france-renoir-museum-french-riviera-art-heist\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
